                     skos:prefLabel "MolecularTopology" ;
                     emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """In chemistry, topology provides a way of describing and predicting the molecular structure within the constraints of three-dimensional space.
This class includes the three-dimensional arrangement of the atoms that constitute a molecule and the molecular connectivity defined as the list of bonds, angles, dihedral angles, and improper angles between atoms."""@en .


