###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/openmodel#MollerPlesset
:MollerPlesset rdf:type owl:Class ;
                 rdfs:subClassOf :PostHartreeFock ;
                 skos:prefLabel "MollerPlesset" ;
                 emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "Møller–Plesset perturbation theory (MP) is one of several quantum chemistry post–Hartree–Fock ab initio methods in the field of computational chemistry. It improves on the Hartree–Fock method by adding electron correlation effects by means of Rayleigh–Schrödinger perturbation theory (RS-PT), usually to second (MP2), third (MP3) or fourth (MP4) order."@en .


