                   emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "Quantum ESPRESSO is an integrated suite of Open-Source computer codes for electronic-structure calculations and materials modeling at the nanoscale. It is based on density-functional theory, plane waves, and pseudopotentials."@en .


