           skos:prefLabel "Solvent" ;
           emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "A solvent (from the Latin solvō, \"loosen, untie, solve\") is a substance that dissolves a solute, resulting in a solution."@en .


