###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/openmodel#TemperatureMDT
:TemperatureMDT rdf:type owl:Class ;
                  rdfs:subClassOf :MolecularDynamicsTask ;
                  skos:prefLabel "TemperatureMDT" ;
                  emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 "Set the velocity of all atoms to the initial temperature."@en .


###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/openmodel#TemperatureScanMDT
:TemperatureScanMDT rdf:type owl:Class ;
                      rdfs:subClassOf :MolecularDynamicsTask ;
                      skos:prefLabel "TemperatureScanMDT" ;
                      emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """Initialise the run section of a MD simulation, its MolecularDynamicsOutput, and perform a scan in temperature at constant pressure. The scan is defined by a ramp where the temperature is linearly increased, and equilibration phase, and a production phase. Each step is controlled with its own number of steps, and the sequence is repeated from T_start to T_stop with increments DT.

The time integration is done in the isenthalpic (NPH) ensemble with a Nose-Hoover barostat, while the temperature control is done with a Langevin thermostat. The resulting ensemble is NPT."""@en .


