###  https://w3id.org/emmo/domain/openmodel#defaultMD
:defaultMD rdf:type owl:Class ;
             rdfs:subClassOf :MolecularDynamicsOutput ;
             skos:prefLabel "defaultMD" ;
             emmo:EMMO_967080e5_2f42_4eb2_a3a9_c58143e835f9 """Compute standard thermodynamic quantities in this order:
* Simulation step
* Total Energy
* van deer Walls Energy (short-range)
* Coulomb Energy (real part of the potential)
* Long-range Coulomb Energy (reciprocal part of the potential)
* Bond Energy
* Angle Energy
* Dihedral Energy
* Improper Energy
* Kinetic Energy
* Potential Energy
* Temperature
* Pressure
* Volume
* Density
* Elapsed CPU time

Save a MD trajectory as a separate file (DCD or DUMP formats)."""@en .


